# Project-specific
# outputs/ is generated and ignored, EXCEPT the trained weights: the app is
# unusable without them and falls back to an untrained head that returns random
# severity scores. They are model coefficients (W, b, threshold, provenance) —
# no participant data. Git cannot re-include a path inside an ignored directory,
# hence the stepwise unignore rather than a plain "!outputs/weights/".
outputs/*
!outputs/weights/
outputs/weights/*
!outputs/weights/*.npz
data/synthetic/sessions/
data/edaic/sessions/
data/live/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Real study data (KoBoToolbox export: identifiable clinical audio + scores).
# The adapter writes outside the repo by default; these patterns are a backstop
# for anyone who runs it with --out pointing inside the tree. Never commit these.
data/kobo/sessions/
data/kobo/audio/
data/kobo/*.xlsx
data/kobo/*.csv
data/kobo/registry.json
*.m4a
kobo_clean_analytic.xlsx
kobo_pid_key.xlsx
